Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): slim Today coach brief, full recovery on Progress

Replace heavy recovery pillars + async CoachEngine wall on web Today
with compact offline CoachBrief (score, summary, chips, water taps).
Progress gets full recovery card with pillars. Drop focus emoji on
mobile exercise rows for calmer protocol list.
